### Publish stock master embedding event after external CRUD
POST http://localhost:8080/stock/embedding-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "STOCK_UPDATED",
  "stockPoid": 101
}

### Publish stock unit embedding event after external CRUD
POST http://localhost:8080/stock/embedding-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "STOCK_UNIT_UPDATED",
  "stockUnitPoid": 12
}

### Search with defaults
POST http://localhost:8080/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "french orange crate",
  "includeCandidates": true
}

### Search with runtime model override
POST http://localhost:8080/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "milk ltr",
  "chatModel": "gpt-5.5",
  "fallbackModel": "gpt-5.4-mini",
  "embeddingModel": "text-embedding-3-small",
  "includeCandidates": true
}

### Get all active stock from common DB
GET http://localhost:8080/stock/common-db

### Get all active stock units from common DB
GET http://localhost:8080/stock-unit/common-db

### Clear local embedding tables
DELETE http://localhost:8080/stock/embeddings/local

### Sync all active stock and stock units from common DB into local embedding tables
POST http://localhost:8080/stock/embeddings/sync-all
